Copyright (c) 2026 Shohail Mahmud

Original game, artwork, audio, fonts, level design, characters and all related
trademarks:

    Copyright (c) Rovio Entertainment. All rights reserved.


WHAT THIS MEANS
---------------

This repository is only a Rust reimplementation of the game engine, written by
Shohail Mahmud. Nothing in it originates from Rovio except the 1.2.0.ipa file,
which is Rovio's copyrighted application and is included here solely so the
rebuild can run.

All rights to Angry Birds belong to Rovio Entertainment. That includes the name,
the logo, the bird and pig characters, every sprite, texture, sound effect,
music track, font and level layout. Shohail Mahmud claims no ownership of any of
it and no affiliation with Rovio.

The MIT license below covers Shohail Mahmud's own source code and nothing else.
It grants no rights to the original game, its assets, its name or its
trademarks. If Rovio asks for this project or the 1.2.0.ipa file to be taken
down, it will be removed.


